---
import learning from '../data/learning.json';
import Shell from '../layouts/Shell.astro';
import {people} from '../data/content.json';
const sorted=[...people].sort((a,b)=>a.name.localeCompare(b.name));
---
<Shell title="Stories of the Prophets Explorer"><section class="intro"><span class="eyebrow">Read the Quranic account</span><h1>{learning.heading}</h1><p>25 named prophets. 50 selected readings. Open a profile, read the source, and check what you noticed.</p></section><div class="notice bottom-gap"><p>This is a selected reading library, not a complete biography collection. Profiles are alphabetical; no historical order is implied. Brief mentions are presented without adding an unsourced life story.</p></div><section class="panel bottom-gap"><div class="panel-body filters"><label class="field">Find a prophet or reading<input id="filter" type="search" placeholder="Musa, gratitude, patience…"/></label><label class="field">Reading area<select id="category"><option value="">All areas</option>{[...new Set(people.map(p=>p.category))].sort().map(g=><option>{g}</option>)}</select></label><label><input type="checkbox" id="saved-only"/> Saved only</label><button class="button secondary" id="export">Copy saved reading list</button><span class="micro" id="count" aria-live="polite"></span></div></section><div class="card-grid">{sorted.map((p)=><article class="panel activity-card" data-item-id={p.id} data-category={p.category}><span class="eyebrow">{p.category}</span><h2><a href={`/prophet/${p.id}/`} data-reading-link={p.id}>{p.name}</a></h2><p>{p.focus}</p><span class="micro">{p.readings.map(r=>r.ref).join(' · ')}</span><div class="actions"><a class="button" href={`/prophet/${p.id}/`}>Open readings ↗</a><button class="button secondary" data-save={p.id} aria-pressed="false">Save reading</button></div></article>)}</div><div class="empty" id="empty" hidden><h2>No profiles match</h2><p>Try another name or reading focus, or turn off Saved only.</p></div><script>import '../lib/library';</script></Shell>
